From: TactiQ OS <andrey@tactiq.ai>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] corenetwork: declare tactiq_stop_port_t on TCP 49318

tactiq-stop answers agentgateway's extAuthz question before every tool
call, on loopback. Like agentgateway_port_t, its port type is bound to a
number with portcon, which only the base policy accepts.

network_port() declares tactiq_stop_port_t and generates
corenet_tcp_bind_tactiq_stop_port() (used by tactiq_stop) and
corenet_tcp_connect_tactiq_stop_port() (used by agentgateway).

49318 is in the IANA dynamic range, next to agentgateway's 49317, and is
not covered by any port or range declared in this file (checked against
refpolicy main: nothing between virt_migration's 49152-49216 and 50000
covers it).

Placed directly after agentgateway; applies on top of 0001.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [TactiQ OS specific service]

Signed-off-by: TactiQ OS <andrey@tactiq.ai>
---
 policy/modules/kernel/corenetwork.te.in | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/policy/modules/kernel/corenetwork.te.in b/policy/modules/kernel/corenetwork.te.in
--- a/policy/modules/kernel/corenetwork.te.in
+++ b/policy/modules/kernel/corenetwork.te.in
@@ -93,6 +93,7 @@
 network_port(afs_vl, udp,7003,s0)
 network_port(afs3_callback, tcp,7001,s0, udp,7001,s0)
 network_port(agentgateway, tcp,49317,s0)
+network_port(tactiq_stop, tcp,49318,s0)
 network_port(agentx, udp,705,s0, tcp,705,s0)
 network_port(amanda, udp,10080-10082,s0, tcp,10080-10083,s0)
 network_port(amavisd_recv, tcp,10024,s0)
